WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.000
We'll be right back.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:30.480
Let's go.

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:43.880
There's no mistaking it.

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:45.640
This is...

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:47.250
It's a conspiracy!

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:49.620
Perfect.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:01.700
I'm a big fraud

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:06.340
I'm a big fraud

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:13.990
I'm a big fraud

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:38.820
Lately, my head's been in a bad shape.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.520
Maybe it's because I sleep 16 hours a day.

00:03:43.360 --> 00:03:51.830
From the next room, the theme song of the beautiful girl anime is still playing today.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.690
It's every day since the beginning of the first month.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:59.360
I like it.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.720
I've heard this phrase hundreds of times.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.260
But what's the name of the girl who's purring?

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:07.780
The girl who's purring?

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.940
That's not a human, is it?

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:15.780
It means a girl like a pudding?

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:18.320
I'm purring.

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.840
I'm purring.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:27.810
Shut up!

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:31.560
Shut up!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:42.410
Today is the limit of patience.

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:43.970
It's not good to listen to a song that you don't like forever.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.650
I'll go to the lecture.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:51.840
It's not like that.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.200
It's simple.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:54.870
Open the door.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.850
Just walk a few steps to the next room.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:04:59.840
And...

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.900
I knocked on the door and opened the door.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.180
Shut up, Aniota!

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.390
That's all I have to say.

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:08.810
That's all I have to say.

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:12.180
That's all I have to say.

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:18.700
I heard a voice.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.020
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:05:23.100 --> 00:05:24.930
It feels bad, doesn't it?

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.280
Like an idiot.

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:32.210
I don't want you to walk outside.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:33.070
Chicken!

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:34.810
Don't say that.

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:36.520
Please forgive me.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.590
In the summer of the first year of college,

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:44.520
I went to school in a thick suit.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:59.540
I tried to run away.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:07.110
I went back to my apartment and stopped going out from that day.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:19.730
Engei Zanmai. Today's theme is Seidaka Awadachi-so.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:30.960
Thank you for watching.

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:12.230
There is a conspiracy in this world.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:15.450
That's right, that's what that person said.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.910
It is true that there is a conspiracy in the world.

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:29.460
But senpai, 99% of what is called conspiracy is just a delusion, or a deliberate lie.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:31.080
In other words, he's a total idiot.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.440
Then, 1% is real?

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:38.230
My junior is being bullied.

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:39.970
He's a student in the Middle East.

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:43.950
I wanted to show my seniors something good.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:45.640
I'm sorry.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:51.760
Please tell me, senior.

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:53.530
Is this...

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:54.930
...some kind of conspiracy?

00:07:58.320 --> 00:07:59.800
Jigo!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.940
Stop it! The ballroom is not over! Be quiet!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.400
You're the loudest!

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:09.980
Toku! If there's anything you want to say, just say it!

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:22.930
That's...harmful...harmful...this is...this is...this is...this is...this is...

00:08:22.930 --> 00:08:25.860
Everything is...harmful?

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:44.620
I was involved in a real conspiracy with a probability of less than 1%!

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:53.230
Congratulations, Sato-kun. You finally realized it.

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:59.650
The reason why things don't go well is to get you involved in everything.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:00.310
It was a conspiracy.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.340
But who is such a conspiracy?

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:07.310
It's a conspiracy.

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.180
What are you doing, Grey TV?

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:13.920
I'm a secret agent.

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:17.600
Secret agent?

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:29.970
How can you do such a simple thing?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.080
You didn't notice that, did you?

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:39.430
Speaking of anime,

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.540
I'm not good at dealing with people.

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:46.460
I tend to be drawn to it.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:52.160
But, by supporting an interesting anime by NHK,

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:53.920
you've mass-produced anime,

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:57.440
and you've bought a part of NEET's large-scale appearance, haven't you?

00:09:57.560 --> 00:09:59.880
In other words, NHK-

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:08.560
Komori Kyokai

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:15.570
I am the man who created the conspiracy of Japan's Hikikomori Kyokai

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:19.350
Sato Tatsuhiro, 22 years old

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:22.440
I have been in Komori for 3 years

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:24.060
This is my 4th year

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:28.140
There is a karate master

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.790
called Yamaniku

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.540
I learned the secret of breaking rocks.

00:10:33.900 --> 00:10:36.770
If I can get power by burning,

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:41.030
I should have the power to break the building too.

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:46.700
Who is it?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:48.620
The one who broke the bottle...

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.370
It's him!

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:58.010
Y-Yubato!

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:58.310
No!

00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.910
N-No, before that...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.020
I need to do something about the fragments!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.960
Utsutsuke, first, clean up the fragments,

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.460
and then, make sure there are no scratches,

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:06.640
and then...

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:08.080
You're so annoying!

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:09.440
That's not the point right now!

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:11.500
I'm basically a NEET.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:14.080
NEETs just come out in front of people.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:16.210
But...

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.060
It's not good to have electricity bills...

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:18.740
It's not good.

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:20.580
I haven't thrown it in for a while.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:22.600
If the electricity supply is stopped,

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:25.960
the comfortable NEET life will not be delayed, right?

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:27.140
That's...

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:28.660
very bad!

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:32.180
Y-Yes!

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:38.520
You're replying, right?

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:39.280
Yes!

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:22.160
I'm sorry for making you all so busy.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:26.940
Are you okay?

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:28.200
Your face is bleeding.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:28.700
What?

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.710
Ah, no problem at all, yes.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.260
Ah, is that so?

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:41.960
Actually, we're giving out these kind of notes for free, but...

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:42.480
Eh?

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:47.150
This is this month's special issue.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:48.090
Do you know NEET?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:51.790
It's about people who don't go to work or school, but stay at home.

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:54.910
Right now, socially...

00:12:54.910 --> 00:12:57.740
Could it be that this old lady knows that I'm staying at home?

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:01.320
Could it be that I'm...

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.660
Is he a famous NEET in this town?

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:05.090
Is that so?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:07.520
Hehehe

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.070
Is this the end of your interest?

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:12.250
If so, please take a look at it once!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:15.130
Hehehehe, I'm Needless?

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:16.510
That can't be true, right?

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:20.280
Don't tell me I haven't been listening to someone else's mouth for almost a year?

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.580
You're going to go to college because of this?

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.580
And you'll be unemployed?

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.020
And you're going to be desperate for your future?

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:28.680
There's no way that's going to happen, right?

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:29.940
You're going to be...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.240
Are you sure you're okay?

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:32.120
Of course I'm sure you're okay!

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:33.740
I...

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:35.430
I'm...

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.480
It won't be hard for you if you pray and get better.

00:13:43.180 --> 00:13:43.900
What do you know?

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:46.850
Even I don't understand...

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:49.870
There's no way you'll understand!

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:03.110
Misaki-chan

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:35.420
I'll tell you the truth.

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:36.970
I know what to do.

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.310
Get out of here right now.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:41.800
You can start a part-time job or anything else.

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:45.750
If you do that, it will be a lie to say that NEET is in this room.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:51.080
That girl, too.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:52.980
I was in my room today.

00:14:53.640 --> 00:14:54.180
I think it's because my part-time job was off.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.040
Misaki

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:06.020
I'm not a dog!

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:11.400
I'm a dog!

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:12.560
I'm a Tissue!

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:15.310
I'm a Tissue!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:25.870
I'm a Tissue!

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:53.110
the vines

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:59.980
the vines

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:00.780
I heard you're looking for a part-time job.

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:09.920
Bye!

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.130
I heard you're looking for a part-time job here.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:19.190
No!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:20.480
I'm sorry

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:22.490
I love this song.

00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:23.980
Bye!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:28.780
Finally

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:31.260
Bye?

00:16:31.300 --> 00:16:33.850
Bye-bye.

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:40.960
Bye-bye.

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:41.240
What?

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:46.120
B-Bike?

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:46.760
You like bikes?

00:16:46.760 --> 00:16:47.760
I like them!

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:49.220
I can get used to the wind.

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:50.020
I can't stand the movement of that engine.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.520
How about we go on a tour together next time?

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:59.570
But I've never ridden a bike before, but...

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.760
See you later.

00:17:02.840 --> 00:17:07.160
I'll kill you!

00:17:12.430 --> 00:17:14.920
But I know I can't die this way.

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:21.120
Because I'm going to faint before I die, and my hands are going to loosen.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:26.600
Why is she here?

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:32.320
Is it okay to work part-time with a body that can be used by God?

00:17:32.980 --> 00:17:39.150
No, even if it is a body that can be used by God, money is necessary.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:40.920
Because I'm a living human.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:44.670
That living human...

00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:12.270
If you think about it,

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:16.330
At this time, the electricity employee does not come to my house on purpose.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.100
That's why I ignored this call.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.730
It doesn't affect my life at all.

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:24.710
No, I should rather ignore it.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:26.330
Yesterday...

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:29.060
I accidentally opened the door, but for the sake of it...

00:18:29.660 --> 00:18:29.980
Good night.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:31.470
Whoa!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:38.530
Huh? Huh?

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.200
Did you come all the way here to deliver it to me?

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:10.340
Sato Tatsuhiro-dono, you have been greatly inspired by my project.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.990
So please come to Mita Yonchome Park at 9 o'clock tonight.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:19.830
Nakahara Misaki

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:25.870
If you're a religious friend, you're too safe.

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.980
I think there's someone who's going to get caught in this.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:33.340
But that's their way of doing things.

00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:36.360
They use young girls to attract young men.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:38.200
It's a way of exorcism.

00:19:38.460 --> 00:19:41.220
She's an unrivaled woman.

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:44.880
Even if I get caught by such a woman...

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:05.930
Please come to the fourth park you saw at 9 o'clock.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:12.070
That park is the only place I can relax in other than this room.

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:20.830
I was thinking of relaxing in that park tonight.

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:29.870
I was bewitched by a letter that I didn't know the reason, and my plans went crazy.

00:20:30.600 --> 00:20:37.690
That's right. I was going to go to that park from the beginning.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:53.270
I was looking for a huge possibility.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.120
That letter may just be a prank.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:03.980
If that's the case, I'll be in a total mess right now.

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:11.730
What are you talking about? I was supposed to be here from the beginning.

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:15.330
Why did you run away in the daytime?

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:25.240
I was in a hurry because I didn't have enough people.

00:21:25.320 --> 00:21:28.300
Are you afraid to go out and work?

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:31.000
Because I'm a hikikomori.

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:35.140
I'm sure you'll be fine.

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:37.900
I know how to escape from the hikikomori.

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:42.660
And I've known about you for a long time.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:46.960
I'm here to help you.

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:57.470
Welcome to the project.

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:15.040
You stupid human

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:26.660
You stupid human

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:31.940
You can't run away!

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:33.360
It's Hitomi's request.

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:34.430
I can write about 100 songs!

00:23:35.550 --> 00:23:37.510
Next time, welcome to the Creator.
